---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'USIVA Route Atlas | Find the Right Page';
const description = 'A clear USIVA route atlas for visa categories, planning, official tools, employer resources, research briefs, questions, and source-aware reference pages.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/other-pages.html';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  activePath="/other-pages.html"
  canonical={canonical}
  topbarMessage="Route atlas · choose the page that matches your question."
  topbarLink={{ label: 'Open official tools', href: '/official-tools.html' }}
>
  <section class="atlas-intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="shell-container atlas-intro__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">USIVA / route atlas</p>
      <h1 id="page-title">Find the route that matches your question.</h1>
      <p class="atlas-intro__lede">Use this index as a decision map. Start with the question in front of you, then move to the page that can help you frame it.</p>
      <nav class="intro-actions" aria-label="Route atlas next steps">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="#atlas">Browse the routes</a>
        <a class="button button--outline" href="/contacts.html">Prepare a question</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section atlas-index" id="atlas" aria-labelledby="atlas-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">The index</p>
        <h2 id="atlas-heading">Choose by reader job.</h2>
        <p>Every route has a different job. If the answer depends on personal facts, stop at orientation and use the question brief to prepare a verified handoff.</p>
      </header>

      <ul class="route-index">
        <li><a href="/visa.html"><span>01</span><strong>Visa directory</strong><small>Start with a route overview and its official-source handoffs.</small><em>I need a route</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/visa-categories.html"><span>02</span><strong>Visa categories</strong><small>Compare temporary, study, work, family, and permanent-route groupings.</small><em>I need to compare</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/services.html"><span>03</span><strong>Services</strong><small>Organize a readiness file, pathway map, authorization question, or source trail.</small><em>I need a plan</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/employers.html"><span>04</span><strong>Employer resources</strong><small>Orient I-9, E-Verify, hiring records, and employer-side handoffs.</small><em>I represent an employer</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/official-tools.html"><span>05</span><strong>Official tools</strong><small>Move from a planning question to case-status, visa, and employer resources.</small><em>I need to verify</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/briefs.html"><span>06</span><strong>Research briefs</strong><small>Read short, source-led notes about planning and compliance questions.</small><em>I need context</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/articles.html"><span>07</span><strong>Articles</strong><small>Follow longer explanations with explicit limits and next references.</small><em>I want a deeper read</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog.html"><span>08</span><strong>Field notes</strong><small>Follow question-led reading paths about preparation, boundaries, and sources.</small><em>I need orientation</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/tips-faq.html"><span>09</span><strong>Tips &amp; FAQ</strong><small>Check common planning questions and verify-before-you-act prompts.</small><em>I have a quick question</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacts.html"><span>10</span><strong>Question brief</strong><small>Prepare a concise handoff and send sensitive information only through the verified official channel.</small><em>I need a next action</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/media-gallery.html"><span>11</span><strong>Media &amp; visual aids</strong><small>Inspect planning artifacts for files, pathways, boundaries, and source trails.</small><em>I learn visually</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/about.html"><span>12</span><strong>About USIVA</strong><small>Understand the service boundary and the relationship to its public context.</small><em>I need the short version</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
        <li><a href="/pricing.html"><span>13</span><strong>Scope &amp; fees</strong><small>Read the scope posture and questions to ask before payment.</small><em>I need scope</em><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section starting-points" aria-labelledby="start-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Three starting points</p>
        <h2 id="start-heading">Begin with the sentence that sounds most like you.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="starting-list">
        <a href="/tips-faq.html"><span>“I am still learning.”</span><strong>Read the basics</strong><small>Use Tips &amp; FAQ to name the first question and prepare the source handoff.</small></a>
        <a href="/services.html"><span>“I am preparing.”</span><strong>Build the file</strong><small>Use Services to sort records, timing, authorization, and the next authority to ask.</small></a>
        <a href="/contacts.html"><span>“I need to hand this off.”</span><strong>Write the brief</strong><small>Use Contacts to keep the first message concise and protect sensitive information.</small></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section source-section" aria-labelledby="source-heading">
    <div class="shell-container source-section__grid">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Official starting points</p>
        <h2 id="source-heading">Use USIVA for orientation, then verify with the source that controls the matter.</h2>
      </header>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.uscis.gov/" rel="noreferrer">USCIS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://travel.state.gov/content/travel/en/us-visas.html" rel="noreferrer">U.S. Department of State / U.S. visas <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://studyinthestates.dhs.gov/" rel="noreferrer">DHS Study in the States <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/official-tools.html">USIVA official tools directory <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .atlas-intro {
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .atlas-intro__inner {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .atlas-intro h1 {
    max-width: 17ch;
  }

  .atlas-intro__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .intro-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .section-heading,
  .starting-points > div > header,
  .source-section h2 {
    max-width: 60rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .starting-points h2,
  .source-section h2 {
    max-width: 26ch;
  }

  .route-index {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .route-index li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .route-index a {
    align-items: start;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem 1rem;
    grid-template-columns: 2.2rem minmax(12rem, 0.62fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(10rem, 0.34fr) 1.2rem;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-1);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .route-index a:hover {
    background: var(--color-mist);
  }

  .route-index a > span,
  .route-index b {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .route-index strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .route-index small {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .route-index em {
    color: var(--color-soft);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .starting-points {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .starting-points h2 {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .starting-points .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-on-dark);
  }

  .starting-list {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .starting-list a {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-inline-start: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    display: block;
    min-height: 13rem;
    padding: var(--space-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .starting-list a:last-child {
    border-inline-end: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .starting-list a:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .starting-list span {
    color: var(--color-on-dark);
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3);
  }

  .starting-list strong {
    color: var(--color-paper);
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  .starting-list small {
    color: var(--color-on-dark-muted);
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin-block-start: 0.35rem;
  }

  .source-section {
    background: var(--color-mist);
  }

  .source-section__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
  }

  .source-section ul {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .source-section li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .source-section a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    display: flex;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 750;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .source-section a span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .route-index a {
      grid-template-columns: 2.2rem minmax(12rem, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1fr) 1.2rem;
    }

    .route-index em {
      grid-column: 2 / 4;
    }

    .starting-list,
    .source-section__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .starting-list a {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .starting-list a:last-child {
      border-inline-end: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .intro-actions .button {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .route-index a {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr) 1.2rem;
    }

    .route-index small,
    .route-index em {
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .route-index b {
      grid-column: 3;
      grid-row: 1;
      justify-self: end;
    }
  }
</style>
